WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,400
But he said that his friend is 1.75 meters tall and has a delicate face.

2
00:00:02,400 --> 00:00:04,000
So it can’t be you at all

3
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:05,600
I didn't think about it that way

4
00:00:05,800 --> 00:00:07,800
How is he?

5
00:00:07,800 --> 00:00:10,000
He came to find you after we escaped that day

6
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:11,400
But the base feels too dangerous

7
00:00:11,400 --> 00:00:13,400
Seeing how emotional he was, I used mind control on him.

8
00:00:13,400 --> 00:00:15,200
Mind control no wonder

9
00:00:15,200 --> 00:00:17,400
That red golden river is definitely Song Huai

10
00:00:17,400 --> 00:00:19,000
What is Song Huai's superpower?

11
00:00:19,000 --> 00:00:20,200
I don't know

12
00:00:20,200 --> 00:00:21,400
The base didn't let me ask.

13
00:00:21,400 --> 00:00:25,910
It seems to be a secret-level superpower.

14
00:00:26,310 --> 00:00:28,510
Song Huai’s super powers accumulate strategic value

15
00:00:28,510 --> 00:00:30,310
Only then would they be tightly blocked by that group of people

16
00:00:30,510 --> 00:00:34,180
I don’t know what kind of torture he is suffering now.

17
00:00:41,040 --> 00:00:43,040
Are you still getting used to being in the base?
